🎓 CampusHub – Smart College Life Assistant

CampusHub is a modern, student-friendly web application designed to make college life easier and more organised. It brings essential academic tools together in one place, helping students manage their attendance, assignments, timetable, CGPA and study sessions.

🚀 Features

- Attendance Calculator: Track attendance percentage and calculate how many classes you need to attend.
- CGPA Calculator: Calculate your CGPA with ease.
- Assignment Tracker: Organise assignments, tasks and upcoming deadlines.
- Weekly Timetable: Manage your weekly class schedule.
- Study Timer: Improve productivity with a built-in study timer.
- Responsive Dashboard: Access CampusHub on desktops, tablets and mobile devices.
- Local Data Storage: Save your information using browser LocalStorage.

🛠️ Tech Stack

Technology| Purpose
Next.js| Frontend framework
React.js| UI components
TypeScript| Programming language
Tailwind CSS| Styling
Lucide React| Icons
Recharts| Data visualisation
LocalStorage| Local data persistence

